Unless you have some way to remove curses. If you can cast the remove
curse spell, or a scroll of same and have something else you want to
uncurse anyway, it's easy: pick it up, name it, cast remove curse and
drop it.

Or if you have a wand of cancellation: pick up the stone, drop everything
you don't want cancelled and zap the wand at yourself (no, you won't lose
intrinsics, the wand works only on your inventory).

If you can dig behind the stone upstairs and kick it from there, there's
not even any need to pick up the one you can't move.

